Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.23,0:00:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Earth, 70 million years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.70,0:00:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.41,0:00:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You were sent here by a time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.54,0:00:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you, Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.08,0:00:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii has looked for Okarin
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.08,0:00:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,in many, many, many worldlines, chasing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.01,0:00:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.51,0:00:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You could say that the Okarin here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.68,0:00:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,is one of many Okarins, but you could say
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.10,0:00:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,he's the original Okarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.64,0:00:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You could also say the Mayushii here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.56,0:00:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,is one of many Mayushiis,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.36,0:00:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,but that she's the original too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.11,0:00:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And so,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.11,0:00:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Okarin and Mayushii are gonna die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.70,0:00:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But I believe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.03,0:01:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,our legacy{wills} will carry on to the Okarin and Mayushii in Akihabara,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.29,0:01:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,70 million years from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.29,0:01:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.88,0:01:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,it's okay.
