Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.83,0:03:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you could hold this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.42,0:03:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.46,0:03:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. Keep it spread out like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.34,0:03:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That ribbon's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.93,0:03:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.51,0:03:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to try it on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.31,0:03:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have some cosplay outfits for ComiMa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.60,0:03:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Cosplay, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.73,0:03:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Interested?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.27,0:03:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.32,0:03:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't wear this in public...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.07,0:03:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.45,0:03:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.87,0:03:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We were racing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.45,0:03:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.08,0:03:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But we're finished too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.58,0:04:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,With this, we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.88,0:04:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.00,0:04:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,a time leap machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.01,0:04:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like an evil organization's brainwashing machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.06,0:04:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a little PhoneWave, now with headphones!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.56,0:04:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It may not look like much,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.98,0:04:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,but theoretically, this can transmit memories into the past...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.32,0:04:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,...especially now that we can use the LHC.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.86,0:04:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The LHC's involved?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.12,0:04:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's basically a problem of compression.
Comment: 0,0:04:35.66,0:04:40.21,Sign12A,,0,0,0,,Me on 2010/8/13 AD          Hippocampus
