Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.69,0:05:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Like putting a mattress that won't fit in a closet inside a compression bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.78,0:05:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Strictly speaking, it's different,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.78,0:05:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's close enough for you to get an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.37,0:05:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Like using D-Mail, we can send data to the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.83,0:05:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, we use the cell phone's spread-spectrum waves to copy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.29,0:05:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,the future memories to the brain in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.92,0:05:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This creates a "you" with memories from the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.92,0:05:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The furthest back you can send data is 48 hours at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.80,0:05:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Any further and the two brain states'
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.76,0:05:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,difference is too large,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.85,0:05:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and it might fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.22,0:05:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's one other problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.14,0:05:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.27,0:05:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike the PhoneWave or D-Mail,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.56,0:05:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,we need a test subject,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.44,0:05:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,or we can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.32,0:05:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we're sending memories,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.24,0:05:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,the only way to know if it succeeded
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.99,0:05:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,is to use a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.57,0:06:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, one of us has to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.79,0:06:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.37,0:06:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe, tell me what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.17,0:06:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Not Hououin... but Okabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.26,0:06:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.97,0:06:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,'Sup?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.01,0:06:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We still don't know why the line connected to SERN, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.85,0:06:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.35,0:06:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,but there's nothing to indicate the hacking's been discovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.27,0:06:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.35,0:06:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If they'd really noticed, they would've done something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.98,0:06:28.23,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H20&\q2\b1\bord0\fs270\blur4.5\c&HB79493&\frz9.101\3c&H6C5154&\pos(-176.4,608.4)}I'm watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.99,0:06:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we really overcome time?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.03,0:06:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Part of me wants to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.87,0:06:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.20,0:06:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,can't Mayushii buy some bananas,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.25,0:06:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,so we can time leap the bananas Mayushii bought?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.87,0:06:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri, I explained it, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.42,0:06:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Bananas have no memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.21,0:06:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But we won't do the experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.34,0:06:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll announce this to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.88,0:06:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll give the time leap machine to an appropriate organization.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.43,0:07:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.97,0:07:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're okay with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.68,0:07:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii really agrees!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.57,0:07:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hashida ordered pizza, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.70,0:07:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.57,0:07:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll just make the salad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.78,0:07:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll need...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.12,0:07:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.08,0:07:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.79,0:07:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You said salad, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.25,0:07:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, grapefruit salad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.13,0:07:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why do we have fermented soybeans and ground beef in the cart?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.42,0:07:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You can make some good stuff by combining things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.01,0:07:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The grapefruit is sour, so you can
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.72,0:07:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,combine anything with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.05,0:07:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.68,0:07:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.80,0:07:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see once you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.76,0:07:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want salad,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.14,0:07:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a complete salad right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.97,0:07:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's 50% off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.93,0:07:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no fun buying something that's already made.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.52,0:07:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is why guys who are only interested in experiments suck...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.02,0:07:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, here's the coriander.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.19,0:07:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.15,0:07:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The Organization's agent has finally made her move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.82,0:08:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Send help!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.32,0:08:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.28,0:08:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like a cat who just left the vet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.00,0:08:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Your face says, "I'm free at last!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.17,0:08:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.79,0:08:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I expected you to say we were starting
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.50,0:08:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,the time leap experiment immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.59,0:08:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Disappointed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.34,0:08:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.31,0:08:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,On a fundamental level, humans are temporal creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.69,0:08:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Heidegger said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.44,0:08:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I was relieved when you said we wouldn't do the experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.28,0:08:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I think everyone else agrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.74,0:08:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey, if we're having a party,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.70,0:08:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}can I call Luka and Faris?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.79,0:08:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's a developers' conference.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.83,0:08:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri might have been thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.88,0:08:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,that we should've stopped for a long time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.92,0:08:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.72,0:09:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, she may have seen more than the two of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.30,0:09:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,since we've been obsessed with the experiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.97,0:09:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,When do we announce it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.27,0:09:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The sooner the better, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.60,0:09:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me ahead of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.23,0:09:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to contact my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.98,0:09:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.99,0:09:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,...my dad will also find out
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.45,0:09:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,that I made a time leap machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.62,0:09:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we won't be able to go to Aomori.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.91,0:09:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is going to be big.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.29,0:09:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.71,0:09:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll solve my lab mems' problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.30,0:09:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.01,0:09:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You just want to abuse me as your assistant, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.14,0:09:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're my dear companion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.72,0:09:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-Thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.24,0:10:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.07,0:10:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.41,0:10:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you might have a fever
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.74,0:10:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,because you're saying un-assistant-like things!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.28,0:10:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.08,0:10:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not particularly grateful to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.46,0:10:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just being polite...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.04,0:10:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,How tsundere can you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.75,0:10:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not tsundere!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.54,0:10:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.96,0:10:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You always, and I mean always, say the craziest stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.59,0:10:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and now you're talking about companions?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.34,0:10:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all over the place!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.59,0:10:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.76,0:10:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I never waver.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.18,0:10:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My lab mems are my allies,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.77,0:10:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and the world is my enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.81,0:10:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.81,0:10:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so stunned I can't speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.19,0:10:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You just spoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.19,0:10:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't try to trip me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.53,0:10:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.65,0:10:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Snacking while everyone's out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.82,0:10:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's bad manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.28,0:10:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Pizza doesn't taste good cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.45,0:10:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,In any case, why are all three of them the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.25,0:10:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My personal tastes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.33,0:10:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.12,0:10:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you're the boss now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.71,0:11:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.67,0:11:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I was right to buy the ingredients, wasn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.01,0:11:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second. I'll get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.42,0:11:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you stop her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.72,0:11:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I did! With all my might! With all I had!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.80,0:11:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin, you said you'd protect your lab mems, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.47,0:11:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.56,0:11:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It might not be over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.81,0:11:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still possible
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.73,0:11:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,the apple pie was just a failed attempt,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.60,0:11:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and normally...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.40,0:11:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot the radishes...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.94,0:11:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess sweet pickles'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.32,0:11:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,When this meal's over, I'm going to retire and get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.32,0:11:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.24,0:11:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri, I'm so glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.16,0:11:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to the kitchen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.45,0:11:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.83,0:11:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that? I smell something good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.91,0:11:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The pizza's here already?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.75,0:11:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get my chic...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.05,0:11:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is Makise Kurisu here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.43,0:11:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm a lab mem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.47,0:11:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.05,0:11:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm also a lab mem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.93,0:11:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.93,0:11:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.31,0:11:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurisu, did something happen between you and Suzu?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.06,0:12:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.10,0:12:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,She just keeps blaming me for the craziest stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.23,0:12:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,She said I'm a SERN spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.40,0:12:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not crazy. It's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.74,0:12:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you be so certain?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.07,0:12:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any proof?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.86,0:12:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.45,0:12:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But it'll happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.45,0:12:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.03,0:12:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.70,0:12:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I know more about you than you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.79,0:12:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Who you really are,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.17,0:12:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and what you're going to do after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.71,0:12:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.79,0:12:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.38,0:12:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.21,0:12:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurisu...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.30,0:12:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.93,0:12:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back, Mayuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.39,0:12:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Only Hououin Kyouma can handle this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.64,0:12:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Assistant!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.90,0:12:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I raised you better than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.11,0:12:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't raise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.77,0:12:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what the most important thing is about being a mad scientist...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.90,0:12:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not listening, and I won't be a mad scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.57,0:12:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Part-Time Warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.66,0:12:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I warned Okabe Rintaro, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.28,0:12:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Beware of Makise Kurisu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.49,0:12:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you did say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.71,0:13:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You did, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.58,0:13:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And you believed her, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.67,0:13:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.46,0:13:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But you didn't tell me I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.42,0:13:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,About that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.38,0:13:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you making things worse?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.05,0:13:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.26,0:13:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you do better?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.55,0:13:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You know—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.22,0:13:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.05,0:13:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii... doesn't like fighting...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.14,0:13:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.02,0:13:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I don't really like it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.36,0:13:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,When we're all together...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.19,0:13:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it'd be more fun if we were all friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.58,0:13:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Choose wisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.29,0:13:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that card a link?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.71,0:13:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Or a virus?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.34,0:13:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Part-Time Warrior, your fate as a warrior
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.13,0:13:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and the last slice of cake rest on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.81,0:13:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,When in doubt, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.14,0:14:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my motto!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.61,0:14:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You fell for it, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.40,0:14:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you have three viruses.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.57,0:14:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me you give up,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.40,0:14:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'll give you the cherry on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.41,0:14:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Amane is taking this too seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.03,0:14:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin, you're being mean to Suzu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.54,0:14:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,In the world of games, it's do or die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.04,0:14:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how I was raised.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.00,0:14:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The ones lined up in the corner
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.04,0:14:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,are definitely link cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.71,0:14:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing Okabe's personality, I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.59,0:14:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Take one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.09,0:14:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.35,0:14:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Assistant!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.47,0:14:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my assistant, yet you betrayed me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.72,0:14:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop calling me your assistant!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.14,0:14:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate that arrogance of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.02,0:14:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I won't thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.48,0:14:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii will help too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.57,0:14:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Then would you get tea for everyone, Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.95,0:14:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.86,0:14:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.12,0:15:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Kurisu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.03,0:15:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.16,0:15:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii is happy you became friends with Suzu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.46,0:15:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not really friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.29,0:15:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but I think you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.38,0:15:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,When we're all together, it's more fun to get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.51,0:15:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I was talking with Okabe...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.14,0:15:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You may be the one
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.51,0:15:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,with the clearest view of the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.02,0:15:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the only time I've seen Okabe look so serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.15,0:15:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It was kind of creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.98,0:15:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's insulting to Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.86,0:15:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.78,0:15:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.07,0:15:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you, Part-Time Warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.20,0:15:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You won, but not of your own ability!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.16,0:15:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so arrogant!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.37,0:15:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is really good!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.37,0:15:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm off to plan for round two.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.54,0:15:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy it while you can...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.46,0:15:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,the last dessert of your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.67,0:15:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna go check on him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.97,0:15:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.26,0:16:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.60,0:16:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.86,0:16:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.48,0:16:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't find a flashlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.19,0:16:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The Cyalume Saber is Future Gadget #6.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.28,0:16:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't use it as a flashlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.87,0:16:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's bright...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.08,0:16:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem to be having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.25,0:16:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.13,0:16:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The pizza was good,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.96,0:16:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and Suzu and Kurisu were having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.22,0:16:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.39,0:16:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, we've got lots of lab mems now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.35,0:16:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So I was thinking that, lately, we've been lacking a bunch of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.65,0:16:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,A bunch of stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.11,0:16:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, chairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.69,0:16:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And we need more utensils...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.65,0:16:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait just a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.36,0:17:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If we announce we've made a time leap machine,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.45,0:17:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll get some kind of reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.37,0:17:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll solve everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.12,0:17:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.24,0:17:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We can buy chairs and utensils?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.62,0:17:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.12,0:17:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I said we could buy those and still have money left over?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.83,0:17:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Then a microwave too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.92,0:17:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I miss being able to heat up my chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.84,0:17:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll consider it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.84,0:17:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kind of strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.39,0:17:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You looked really lonely in the spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.56,0:17:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The lab was always quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.77,0:17:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All I could hear was the sound of your computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.94,0:17:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And now there's Daru, Kurisu,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.87,0:17:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Luka, Suzu, Moeka,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.62,0:17:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris, Mr. Braun, and Nae...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.29,0:17:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.63,0:17:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay now, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.59,0:18:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if Mayushii isn't your hostage anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.93,0:18:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin! Mayushii!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.39,0:18:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Big trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.14,0:18:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The trains stopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.48,0:18:24.32,SignDerp,,0,0,0,,{\be5\fs48\bord3\c&HC9E0C6&\3c&HB0AA94&\pos(1275,894)}Bomb threat? Akihabara in panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.27,0:18:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,For those of you just tuning in,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.23,0:18:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,the following lines have been shut down due to a bomb threat:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.28,0:18:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamanote Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.53,0:18:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Soubu Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.95,0:18:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A bomb threat, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.78,0:18:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.70,0:18:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to call home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.29,0:18:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This party was to celebrate the time leap machine's completion, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.41,0:18:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.54,0:18:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why mention that now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.04,0:18:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still hacking into SERN?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.29,0:18:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you could say that I went deeper.{teehee}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.92,0:18:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.09,0:18:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a direct connection to SERN.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.98,0:18:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone! You need to...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.28,0:19:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.86,0:19:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.03,0:19:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.49,0:19:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.99,0:19:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What will you do, Mayushii?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.37,0:19:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a taxi home?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.70,0:19:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... I don't have the money for a taxi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.39,0:19:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.98,0:19:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My watch stopped working...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.86,0:19:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.19,0:19:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wound it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.88,0:20:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.46,0:20:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.63,0:20:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,...have been suspended...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.84,0:20:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.01,0:20:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you, put your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.29,0:20:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Moeka...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.50,0:20:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiryu Moeka...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.92,0:20:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,SERN will take the time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.59,0:20:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,SERN?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.88,0:20:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.34,0:20:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Makise Kurisu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.93,0:20:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe Rintaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.43,0:20:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hashida Itaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.10,0:20:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The three of you will come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.35,0:20:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.77,0:21:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiina Mayuri is...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.11,0:21:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,...not necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.69,0:21:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.41,0:21:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.20,0:21:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,For FB... FB... FB...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.81,0:21:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.27,0:21:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.61,0:21:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.16,0:22:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.04,0:22:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell{fuck} is this?!
